  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A biometric targeting overlay system that combines thermal imaging, structural weak-point mapping, and real-time ballistic compensation to guide rounds into joints, optics, and other critical target vulnerabilities. When properly applied, the system transforms a competent shot into a devastating one. When you make a targeted attack (aiming for a specific location or vulnerability), you deal an additional 1d6 precision damage on a hit.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
